WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.605
KOTARO LIVES ALONE

00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:15.992
FOR THE SAKE OF FAMILY/
REASON FOR GOING OUT

00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:19.496
Thank you!

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.750
That kid's been staring for five minutes.
I'm guessing he wants one?

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.419
Should I be the one to talk to him?

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.963
Sir, are you okay?

00:01:29.547 --> 00:01:30.757
What do you mean?

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:34.969
Will you not fly away,
carrying so many of those?

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:38.348
I'm fine. Would you like one too?

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.557
What color do you want?

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:45.855
What is this store thinking,
giving this lanky guy such a job?

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.565
What color do you want?

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:51.736
Will your job be on the line
if you don't give out every balloon?

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.030
Very well. I shall take one--

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.240
What color do you want?

00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:57.659
Let's see, red and blue…

00:01:57.742 --> 00:01:59.702
It's one per person.

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:03.039
One per person? I see.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.208
Then, the red one.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.011
I would like one.

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:19.556
Didn't you come earlier?

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.058
Earlier? What do you mean?

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:24.144
Little boy, you came here earlier.

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:28.398
It couldn't have been. The boy earlier
wasn't wearing a cap, was he?

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.860
He must have come in disguise
since it's one balloon per person.

00:02:31.943 --> 00:02:33.027
Well, that's fine.

00:02:33.945 --> 00:02:35.071
What color do you want?

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:36.739
Let's see,

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.951
I just got red for my younger sister,
so next is,

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:41.828
blue for my younger brother.

00:02:42.412 --> 00:02:44.330
For a younger brother and sister?

00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:45.748
What a nice older brother.

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.626
I would like one.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.087
After the hat, he's wearing sunglasses.

00:02:51.963 --> 00:02:53.256
What color do you want?

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.716
Pink for my mother.

00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:56.593
What? Your mom?

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.469
Your mom really wants one?

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:01.890
Sir, are you saying
mothers do not need balloons?

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:02.932
No…

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.643
You should apologize to
all the mothers in the world.

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.228
I'm sorry.

00:03:08.646 --> 00:03:09.898
How ya doing?

00:03:10.565 --> 00:03:12.358
Now he's doing an impression.

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:14.402
I'll take one.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:16.154
What color do you want?

00:03:16.237 --> 00:03:17.280
Let's see…

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.866
He just got one for his mom, so next is…

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.868
Light blue for my father.

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:23.244
Thought so…

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:27.290
The next one is yours, right?

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:28.583
Good luck!

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.919
Speaking of, isn't he with his parents?

00:03:32.003 --> 00:03:34.380
I've only seen him by himself.

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:36.841
SHIMIZU APARTMENTS

00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:38.968
Balloons?

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:42.847
Neighbor, could you please
draw faces on these?

00:03:42.931 --> 00:03:44.599
A boy and a girl.

00:03:44.682 --> 00:03:47.435
Also, faces of a grown man
and a grown woman.

00:03:47.518 --> 00:03:50.021
What? I'm working now.

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:51.856
You're very good at drawing.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.067
Can't be helped.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.527
203
KOTARO SATO

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:04.911
That kid didn't come back after that…

00:04:07.121 --> 00:04:09.499
It's that kid. He's by himself again.

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:13.211
Wait, he has all of the balloons
I gave him.

00:04:13.294 --> 00:04:16.714
Don't tell me I was scammed…

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:18.675
SISTER MOTHER
BROTHER FATHER

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:39.946
Speaking of which,
how long do balloons last?

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:43.658
Those balloons…

00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:46.661
I hope they last for a while.

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:51.833
See ya, Kotaro!

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:54.252
Yes, I will see you again.

00:04:56.879 --> 00:04:58.423
Mai and Nana,

00:04:58.923 --> 00:05:00.216
your mother is here!

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.093
Okay!

00:05:04.846 --> 00:05:05.930
Kotaro!

00:05:06.597 --> 00:05:07.849
Your pick up is here.

00:05:08.349 --> 00:05:09.559
Let's go home.

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:10.476
Yes.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.522
Kotaro, it's nice!

00:05:14.605 --> 00:05:16.983
Your brother always comes to get you.

00:05:17.066 --> 00:05:18.318
Brother?

00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:20.987
Well then, Miss Teacher.
We'll excuse ourselves now.

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:23.197
Okay, see you tomorrow!

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.536
It's my editor…

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:32.081
Hello, this is Karino.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:32.999
Yes…

00:05:34.459 --> 00:05:35.543
The manuscript today?

00:05:36.252 --> 00:05:37.795
Yes, I understand.

00:05:38.379 --> 00:05:39.589
I'll see you later.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.799
Are you going somewhere?

00:05:41.883 --> 00:05:44.302
It's work. I'm going to the publisher.

00:05:44.969 --> 00:05:48.264
Man, I wonder
if I'll be dragged over the coals again.

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:52.018
That guy's words can really sting.

00:05:52.101 --> 00:05:55.063
I see. Then, I will accompany you.

00:05:55.146 --> 00:05:58.274
What? Why? You better not come!

00:05:58.775 --> 00:06:00.651
SHOGAKUSHA

00:06:03.988 --> 00:06:05.281
Good to see you.

00:06:05.907 --> 00:06:07.325
Good to see you, too.

00:06:07.408 --> 00:06:10.703
I'm sorry. I told him not to come, but…

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:11.871
Well, I mean…

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:15.083
Wait. I didn't know you had a kid, Karino.

00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:17.043
My name is Kotaro Sato.

00:06:17.126 --> 00:06:19.253
I live next door to Sir Karino.

00:06:19.337 --> 00:06:21.631
Oh yeah? I see.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:23.341
A neighbor, huh?

00:06:23.424 --> 00:06:26.469
Okay, whatever. Could you show me
your manuscript?

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.221
Oh, yes…

00:06:31.641 --> 00:06:33.518
Yeah, your drawings are old school.

00:06:33.601 --> 00:06:34.977
I don't like it.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:35.937
Haha.

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:38.898
I tried making the eyes bigger.

00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:40.274
Haha.

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:42.318
Well, let's see.

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:44.278
The character on this page--

00:06:44.362 --> 00:06:46.864
You think so? I think they're good.

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:50.618
Also, in this frame--

00:06:50.701 --> 00:06:52.620
It's fine, the drawing is good.

00:06:52.703 --> 00:06:55.164
Sir, aren't you overthinking it?

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:56.749
Overthinking?

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:57.917
Haha.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.585
DRAWING NOTEBOOK

00:06:59.669 --> 00:07:04.090
Is your drawing talent such that
you have the right to criticize others?

00:07:04.173 --> 00:07:05.550
Here, how about you draw--

00:07:05.633 --> 00:07:07.427
Forget it! Just be quiet!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.719
I'm sorry.

00:07:08.803 --> 00:07:09.887
Haha.

00:07:09.971 --> 00:07:11.139
Heh.

00:07:11.639 --> 00:07:14.016
Mind if I use the restroom?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.268
Go ahead.

00:07:21.149 --> 00:07:22.942
By the way, Sir Editor.

00:07:23.025 --> 00:07:24.360
If I may,

00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:27.363
would you please
not bully Sir Karino so much?

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:33.661
Well, it is true that I don't hold back
with my harsh feedback with Karino.

00:07:33.744 --> 00:07:36.205
However, I have high expectations of him.

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:39.208
Even more so if he'd work on his drawing.

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:42.003
What are your impressions
of my Sir Karino?

00:07:42.086 --> 00:07:42.920
"My"?

00:07:44.172 --> 00:07:46.674
He seems to receive a lot of criticism.

00:07:47.341 --> 00:07:51.804
Well, his story structure is his strength,

00:07:51.888 --> 00:07:54.098
but he's weaker in other areas.

00:07:54.891 --> 00:07:57.518
I have no choice
but to make harsh comments.

00:07:57.602 --> 00:08:02.899
But I say them only because
I believe in him and expect highly of him.

00:08:02.982 --> 00:08:04.650
Please rest assured of that.

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:06.027
I see.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.488
If so, that's fine.

00:08:09.071 --> 00:08:12.116
It's as if he's Karino's guardian.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.451
Haha.

00:08:15.995 --> 00:08:19.790
That editor might be a pretty good person.

00:08:19.874 --> 00:08:20.875
What?

00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:23.503
You better work hard
so he doesn't leave you.

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.421
What the hell happened with them?

00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:29.634
That aside, I'm twice as tired
because of you.

00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:31.969
Seriously, why'd you come along?

00:08:32.053 --> 00:08:35.556
Why, I just thought I could give back
for everything you do.

00:08:36.265 --> 00:08:37.183
Give back?

00:08:37.892 --> 00:08:38.726
Oh.

00:08:47.443 --> 00:08:50.404
Right now, I am your guardian.

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:53.115
I-I don't need one.

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:55.326
I'm too old to need a guardian.

00:08:55.952 --> 00:08:58.079
I will go along with you
next time as well.

00:08:59.497 --> 00:09:00.540
Do what you want.

00:09:04.418 --> 00:09:05.378
This is no good.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.130
I agree, it's no good at all.

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:10.383
Huh? I thought you were on my side.

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:14.512
ROAD TO BEING TRENDY/CHOOSING

00:09:19.517 --> 00:09:21.394
Widdle Kotaro!

00:09:22.144 --> 00:09:25.314
Oh, you're not here to
let me nuzzle your cheeks?

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:28.651
No. That is always a no.

00:09:29.986 --> 00:09:33.364
I would like you to come shopping with me.

00:09:33.447 --> 00:09:36.284
Popular boys stylish fashion?

00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:38.786
Kotaro, you're interested in fashion?

00:09:38.869 --> 00:09:39.745
Yes.

00:09:39.829 --> 00:09:42.456
I want to be very popular and attractive.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.585
Does he have a crush on someone
at kindergarten?

00:09:45.668 --> 00:09:47.712
All right! Sure thing, let's go!

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:49.672
My thanks to you.

00:09:52.133 --> 00:09:53.175
Widdle Kotaro,

00:09:54.176 --> 00:09:59.015
isn't it unnecessary to point a sword
at your friend on the train?

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:02.560
Sir Tamaru, you're a neighbor
who I must keep my guard up against.

00:10:15.531 --> 00:10:17.033
Widdle Kotaro,

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:19.535
just let me dress you!

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:21.162
I refuse.

00:10:21.245 --> 00:10:24.165
Aww. So, what's she like?

00:10:24.248 --> 00:10:26.334
What do you mean by "she"?

00:10:26.417 --> 00:10:28.044
You've got a crush, right?

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:29.629
Is she in the same class?

00:10:30.963 --> 00:10:33.424
Love, I'm talking about love.
Aren't you in love?

00:10:33.507 --> 00:10:35.968
I am not in love.

00:10:36.052 --> 00:10:38.012
Also, you should not be peeking.

00:10:38.095 --> 00:10:40.890
C'mon. Don't be shy.

00:10:40.973 --> 00:10:42.350
Can I have a word with you?

00:10:42.933 --> 00:10:45.269
Huh? Who the hell are you?

00:10:45.353 --> 00:10:49.106
Can you tell me your relationship
with the boy in the fitting room?

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.816
- What?
- Sir Tamaru.

00:10:51.692 --> 00:10:54.654
What do you think? Is it stylish?

00:10:56.947 --> 00:10:58.908
You look handsome and cute!

00:10:58.991 --> 00:10:59.825
I see.

00:11:01.702 --> 00:11:03.829
Sir Security guard, do I look cool?

00:11:03.913 --> 00:11:06.916
Huh? Yeah. You look cool.

00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:09.960
Madam over there! Am I looking good?

00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:11.462
How adorable.

00:11:11.545 --> 00:11:14.340
Sir High School Student,
do I look like a ladies' man?

00:11:14.423 --> 00:11:16.133
Yeah, you look good!

00:11:16.217 --> 00:11:19.887
He's asking a guy too.
Maybe it's really not a crush.

00:11:22.598 --> 00:11:25.184
Sir Tamaru, thank you for today!

00:11:25.893 --> 00:11:28.229
I was able to do some good shopping.

00:11:28.312 --> 00:11:30.940
You can invite me again any time,
you know.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.401
I know! Let's get matching leopard--

00:11:33.484 --> 00:11:34.318
Not a chance.

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:38.531
Now I'll be popular as well.

00:11:39.573 --> 00:11:43.119
Who do you want to impress so much,
widdle Kotaro?

00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:46.580
Everyone, of course.
I want everyone to like me.

00:11:47.164 --> 00:11:51.711
I saw on TV that stylish people
are popular and liked.

00:11:55.881 --> 00:11:57.425
Being liked means

00:11:57.508 --> 00:12:00.344
you will no longer
be hated by anyone, right?

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:04.140
Is he from around here?

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:07.810
I wish thugs like him
didn't wander around here so much.

00:12:15.943 --> 00:12:17.069
No nuzzling.

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:21.282
Are you that scared of being hated
by people, widdle Kotaro?

00:12:27.121 --> 00:12:27.955
Yes.

00:12:28.456 --> 00:12:29.832
He's terrifying.

00:12:29.915 --> 00:12:31.876
Seriously.

00:12:32.376 --> 00:12:34.044
Listen, widdle Kotaro.

00:12:34.628 --> 00:12:38.007
Unfortunately, there are people
who are hated even if they're stylish.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.676
So, being stylish isn't everything.

00:12:42.011 --> 00:12:43.304
Is that so?

00:12:43.387 --> 00:12:44.221
Sure.

00:12:44.305 --> 00:12:45.765
To prove that,

00:12:45.848 --> 00:12:48.309
even if you're not stylish,
I like you a lot,

00:12:49.018 --> 00:12:50.019
widdle Kotaro.

00:12:54.648 --> 00:12:57.193
Excuse me, do you have a minute?

00:12:57.276 --> 00:12:58.110
Huh?

00:12:58.194 --> 00:13:01.238
What is your relationship with that boy?

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:03.199
You don't look like his parent.

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:05.367
Man, everyone's out to get me.

00:13:05.451 --> 00:13:06.952
Do you have some ID?

00:13:07.787 --> 00:13:10.498
Sir Tamaru is my neighbor

00:13:10.581 --> 00:13:11.791
and my friend.

00:13:12.374 --> 00:13:13.709
Please take note of that!

00:13:14.335 --> 00:13:16.420
Friend? Is that true?

00:13:16.504 --> 00:13:18.964
Yes. He was shopping with me until--

00:13:19.048 --> 00:13:20.216
Widdle Kotaro!

00:13:21.008 --> 00:13:22.676
I let my guard down.

00:13:23.177 --> 00:13:24.845
Let go of me.

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:36.106
Thank you for selecting me. I'm Miki!

00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:40.861
Kotaro?! Why are you here?

00:13:40.945 --> 00:13:42.655
Good evening, Lady Mizuki.

00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:45.741
I came here to select you, Lady Mizuki.

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:46.951
Select me?!

00:13:48.536 --> 00:13:51.413
I'd better get Karino to come pick you up.

00:13:53.415 --> 00:13:55.751
Sorry for the wait. I called Karino…

00:13:56.252 --> 00:14:00.089
Very well. You may come near me.

00:14:00.172 --> 00:14:01.757
How cute!

00:14:01.841 --> 00:14:04.301
He did an impression,
then he gave me ten yen!

00:14:04.385 --> 00:14:05.845
Super cute!

00:14:05.928 --> 00:14:08.013
Yes, I just wanna gobble him up!

00:14:08.097 --> 00:14:09.515
He's fitting in.

00:14:14.562 --> 00:14:16.564
Why are you causing Mizuki trouble?

00:14:17.857 --> 00:14:20.901
Sir Karino. Would you like some too?

00:14:20.985 --> 00:14:24.280
I'm having the milk neat.
It's rich and delicious here.

00:14:25.364 --> 00:14:27.241
Never mind that. We're going home!

00:14:27.324 --> 00:14:29.952
Sir, aren't you forgetting something?

00:14:31.495 --> 00:14:36.333
You'd better pay for his entrance fee,
selection fee, and milk.

00:14:36.417 --> 00:14:39.211
What, me? Okay, I'll pay…

00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:42.882
Damn it! You'd better pay me back later!

00:14:43.549 --> 00:14:46.010
What's gotten into Kotaro so suddenly?

00:14:47.928 --> 00:14:49.805
Thank you for choosing me.

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:51.640
I'm Miki.

00:14:52.349 --> 00:14:56.562
Lady Mizuki, I may be late to ask this,
but who is Miki?

00:14:58.022 --> 00:15:01.317
My name is Miki
only within this establishment.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.401
Is that so?

00:15:02.484 --> 00:15:06.113
Listen. I'm grateful you chose me,

00:15:06.196 --> 00:15:09.617
but you shouldn't be
coming to this place, Kotaro.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.328
Is it better for me
to come with Sir Karino?

00:15:12.411 --> 00:15:14.705
That's not the issue either…

00:15:15.456 --> 00:15:20.920
If I come here and select you,
I can be with you, Lady Mizuki.

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:23.756
That makes me really happy,

00:15:24.256 --> 00:15:26.216
but we live in the same building.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.427
We don't have to be here
to see each other.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:31.013
We just had snacks the other day…

00:15:32.222 --> 00:15:33.974
Isn't this good?

00:15:34.058 --> 00:15:35.768
Yes, it stretches well.

00:15:35.851 --> 00:15:38.312
Kotaro, do you want more tea?

00:15:38.395 --> 00:15:40.147
Yes, many thanks.

00:15:42.399 --> 00:15:45.069
It's the landlord.
Sorry, I need to take this.

00:15:45.653 --> 00:15:47.071
Yes, hello?

00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:49.782
Yes. Oh, you're right…

00:15:49.865 --> 00:15:51.283
This mochi can stretch forever…

00:15:51.367 --> 00:15:53.077
I need to think about it a bit more.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.537
Yes, okay.

00:15:56.664 --> 00:15:58.999
What should I do?

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:00.501
What was the call about?

00:16:00.584 --> 00:16:03.379
It's about renewing
my lease for this apartment.

00:16:03.462 --> 00:16:05.047
What will you do?

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.966
I've lived here for a while now.

00:16:07.049 --> 00:16:09.718
I wonder if it's time to move soon.

00:16:13.722 --> 00:16:16.558
But you're here, Kotaro,

00:16:16.642 --> 00:16:19.687
and it'd be lonely without you,
so I think I'll renew it!

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.313
He's gone.

00:16:22.773 --> 00:16:26.235
After that,
I went to consult with Sir Karino.

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:29.488
What to do to spend more time with Mizuki?

00:16:29.571 --> 00:16:30.531
Yes.

00:16:30.614 --> 00:16:32.491
I don't know what this is about,

00:16:32.574 --> 00:16:35.077
but if it were me,
I'd go to the club she works at.

00:16:35.661 --> 00:16:37.371
Then, I'd select Mizuki.

00:16:37.913 --> 00:16:38.914
Select…

00:16:41.458 --> 00:16:42.334
Lady Mizuki.

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:48.298
How many times do I need to select you
before you can stay with me forever?

00:16:55.222 --> 00:16:56.181
Kotaro,

00:16:56.765 --> 00:16:58.308
allow me to repeat myself.

00:16:58.934 --> 00:17:01.145
Thank you for selecting me.

00:17:01.228 --> 00:17:02.312
I'm Mizuki.

00:17:04.231 --> 00:17:05.315
It'll be okay.

00:17:05.899 --> 00:17:08.152
Since you selected me,

00:17:08.944 --> 00:17:10.863
I'll be with you from now on, too.

00:17:23.959 --> 00:17:26.045
You did it again…

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.091
Oh well, today is special!

00:17:31.592 --> 00:17:34.053
My treat. I'll host you!

00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:35.262
Seriously?

00:17:35.345 --> 00:17:37.014
You're quite generous.

00:17:37.097 --> 00:17:39.475
- Wow, you're cute as always.
- Stop it!

00:17:41.518 --> 00:17:45.564
In my opinion, the shape
from her bottom to her legs is…

00:17:45.647 --> 00:17:49.902
No, if I had to choose, I'd say the girl
with the big boobs is my preference.

00:17:49.985 --> 00:17:50.903
Hey.

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:56.950
Hey, Kotaro.
Wanna take a picture together?

00:17:57.034 --> 00:17:57.951
A picture?

00:17:58.035 --> 00:18:01.997
Yeah! Why not?
Since we're out here on a picnic date.

00:18:02.081 --> 00:18:02.915
I…

00:18:02.998 --> 00:18:05.501
Mizuki, would you like an ice cream?

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:08.003
Huh?

00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:10.172
I'll take the ice cream,

00:18:10.255 --> 00:18:12.800
but I didn't invite you, Karino.

00:18:12.883 --> 00:18:13.967
You're in the way.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.929
No need to be so blunt.

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:20.682
You're terrible at eating ice cream!

00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:21.600
Huh?

00:18:22.392 --> 00:18:25.145
Your face is covered in ice cream!
How cute!

00:18:25.229 --> 00:18:27.689
I know! Here, look this way!

00:18:27.773 --> 00:18:29.399
Hey, let me take one too.

00:18:29.942 --> 00:18:30.776
Hmm?

00:18:33.737 --> 00:18:36.949
We're trying to take a picture.
What are you doing?

00:18:37.032 --> 00:18:38.909
Stop it, you two!

00:18:38.992 --> 00:18:40.244
You need to calm down!

00:18:40.327 --> 00:18:42.287
You're the one who needs to calm down.

00:18:42.371 --> 00:18:45.124
I am very adverse to pictures.

00:18:45.207 --> 00:18:47.835
Aww, I wanna take a picture with you.

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:50.087
- I apologize.
- Just let me take a pic!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.004
Me too!

00:18:51.088 --> 00:18:52.381
I'm out of here!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.553
No good. I give up.

00:18:58.095 --> 00:19:00.430
You've got no endurance, Karino.

00:19:00.931 --> 00:19:02.850
I won't give up yet!

00:19:02.933 --> 00:19:03.934
I'm running away!

00:19:04.017 --> 00:19:05.602
Hey, wait!

00:19:06.186 --> 00:19:08.230
Wow Mizuki, you've got energy.

00:19:08.313 --> 00:19:11.608
Your heroine and kids aren't drawn
very appealing at all.

00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:13.694
Look this way. C'mon!

00:19:13.777 --> 00:19:14.903
That gives me an idea.

00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:16.947
Wait for me, Kotaro!

00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:27.249
I couldn't get
a single good photo in the end!

00:19:27.332 --> 00:19:29.710
Yes, I put up a fight.

00:19:29.793 --> 00:19:31.712
The best one is

00:19:31.795 --> 00:19:33.672
the back of you here.

00:19:34.423 --> 00:19:36.925
Oh well, I'll send this to my friend.

00:19:37.009 --> 00:19:39.678
Okay, it's fine if it's just my back.

00:19:39.761 --> 00:19:41.597
Speaking of which,

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.725
you hid your face
in the entrance ceremony photo, too.

00:19:44.808 --> 00:19:47.644
Who cares about a photo or two?

00:19:47.728 --> 00:19:48.854
I told you already.

00:19:49.396 --> 00:19:52.441
I am adverse to
having pictures taken of me.

00:19:56.778 --> 00:19:59.156
Hurry up and bring him to me!

00:19:59.239 --> 00:20:01.074
I'm his parent!

00:20:01.158 --> 00:20:02.868
I'm sorry, but please leave.

00:20:02.951 --> 00:20:05.829
His picture was on the website
for this place!

00:20:05.913 --> 00:20:07.956
He's someone's parent.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.791
He's kind of scary.

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:12.044
I hope he leaves soon.

00:20:12.586 --> 00:20:14.254
It's annoying.

00:20:15.088 --> 00:20:17.216
Come out here!

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.892
I need to be careful about pictures.

00:20:28.644 --> 00:20:31.146
No matter how fun the memory is.

00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:38.195
What is it?

00:20:38.695 --> 00:20:41.406
Since we couldn't
get a decent picture yesterday.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.033
I gave it to Mizuki too.

00:20:55.254 --> 00:20:56.296
This is good.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.256
Oh, yeah?

00:20:57.923 --> 00:21:00.217
The drawing needs work, but it's good.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.301
Why you…

00:21:01.385 --> 00:21:04.638
Could you color this in later, too?

00:21:04.721 --> 00:21:05.555
Yeah, sure.

00:21:06.181 --> 00:21:08.558
It'd be nice to go out with Mizuki again.

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:11.812
First, you need to get a series.

00:21:15.941 --> 00:21:17.109
Kobayashi!

00:21:17.693 --> 00:21:19.111
Yes, how can I help you?

00:21:19.736 --> 00:21:21.947
Starting today, you're in charge of this.

00:21:22.447 --> 00:21:25.409
You'll deliver money to the resident
of that address every week.

00:21:26.326 --> 00:21:27.995
What's this money for?

00:21:28.495 --> 00:21:30.372
Couldn't we just wire the money?

00:21:30.455 --> 00:21:32.499
That resident doesn't have a bank account.

00:21:32.582 --> 00:21:34.835
That's rare these days.

00:21:34.918 --> 00:21:37.838
In any case,
is this really a lawyer's job?

00:21:37.921 --> 00:21:41.174
- I want more lawyer-like jobs--
- It's an order from the chief, so go.

00:21:41.842 --> 00:21:43.218
All right, understood.

00:21:45.178 --> 00:21:46.430
Also, Kobayashi…

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:53.895
Okay.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.941
Thank you for coming!

00:22:01.778 --> 00:22:03.322
Nice to meet you!

00:22:03.405 --> 00:22:04.948
Pleased to meet you.

00:22:05.032 --> 00:22:07.701
So, you are the new person in charge.

00:22:07.784 --> 00:22:10.370
Well, why don't you come in for some tea?

00:22:10.454 --> 00:22:12.289
Don't mind if I do!

00:22:14.833 --> 00:22:18.045
I'd heard he was a child,
but I didn't think he was this young.

00:22:19.379 --> 00:22:21.882
Let's toast to the new beginning
between you and I.

00:22:21.965 --> 00:22:23.258
Cheers to you!

00:22:23.342 --> 00:22:24.551
Cheers!

00:22:27.763 --> 00:22:28.680
My apologies.

00:22:28.764 --> 00:22:31.350
I have not heard your name yet.

00:22:31.433 --> 00:22:34.603
Yes! I am Ayano Kobayashi!

00:22:34.686 --> 00:22:35.937
I see.

00:22:36.021 --> 00:22:37.731
Well then, Lady Kobayashi.

00:22:37.814 --> 00:22:41.651
I shall perform a song for you,
Lady Kobayashi.

00:22:42.527 --> 00:22:44.196
Now, lend me your ears.

00:22:44.279 --> 00:22:47.032
Here's the opening theme
to the anime series, Tonosaman.

00:22:47.115 --> 00:22:48.950
"You will eventually be Tonosaman, too!"

00:22:49.034 --> 00:22:50.869
Oh, I was waiting for this!

00:22:50.952 --> 00:22:52.537
I brought a tambourine!

00:22:53.038 --> 00:22:54.206
Well then.

00:22:55.415 --> 00:22:59.711
Tonosaman.

00:23:01.254 --> 00:23:03.173
Was it satisfactory?

00:23:03.256 --> 00:23:04.424
It was the best!

00:23:05.717 --> 00:23:07.052
I am glad to hear that.

00:23:07.928 --> 00:23:11.098
Now, a party isn't a party
without tandoori chicken.

00:23:11.181 --> 00:23:13.600
Have some of this tandoori chicken.

00:23:13.683 --> 00:23:15.185
Tandoori chicken?!

00:23:17.229 --> 00:23:19.147
This is your payment for this week!

00:23:19.856 --> 00:23:20.982
Many thanks to you.

00:23:22.401 --> 00:23:24.945
This is a little something
from myself as well.

00:23:25.028 --> 00:23:26.113
A gift for me?

00:23:26.613 --> 00:23:28.907
Are you sure? Thank you!

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:33.286
Well, the only thing
I can do is welcome you.

00:23:35.747 --> 00:23:37.249
May I ask a question?

00:23:37.332 --> 00:23:40.669
Where did this money come from?

00:23:42.379 --> 00:23:43.463
Also, Kobayashi…

00:23:44.631 --> 00:23:46.675
When you go there,
he'll welcome you in style,

00:23:46.758 --> 00:23:48.635
so, make sure to play along with it.

00:23:48.718 --> 00:23:49.761
What?

00:23:49.845 --> 00:23:52.472
He'll burst out into a song.
Bring a tambourine.

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:55.892
I just need to deliver the money, right?

00:23:55.976 --> 00:23:58.728
If he asks where the money came from,

00:23:58.812 --> 00:24:01.273
say it's a donation from a kind person.

00:24:01.898 --> 00:24:03.608
What does that mean?

00:24:04.192 --> 00:24:05.235
That money,

00:24:05.318 --> 00:24:07.320
is his mother's life insurance money.

00:24:07.404 --> 00:24:08.572
Insurance money?

00:24:09.322 --> 00:24:10.449
So you mean…

00:24:12.242 --> 00:24:14.244
That child's mother is already…

00:24:20.917 --> 00:24:23.211
A kind person donated it!

00:24:23.295 --> 00:24:24.504
Yes.

00:24:24.588 --> 00:24:27.466
The former person in charge
also said the same thing.

00:24:28.133 --> 00:24:31.761
They also said
I can't meet that kind person.

00:24:32.471 --> 00:24:36.349
This is why I'm kind to all of you.

00:24:36.933 --> 00:24:41.605
That way, my gratitude can reach
that kind person too, right?

00:24:44.733 --> 00:24:46.693
I see.

00:24:54.367 --> 00:24:56.536
What are you doing here?

00:24:56.620 --> 00:24:58.538
I was a little worried, so I stopped by.

00:24:58.622 --> 00:25:00.790
So, were you able to give him the money?

00:25:01.458 --> 00:25:04.085
Honestly, I'm feeling a little emotional.

00:25:05.045 --> 00:25:05.962
I see.

00:25:11.259 --> 00:25:13.970
Do you think there will be a day that boy

00:25:14.596 --> 00:25:17.015
finds out the truth
about this "kind person"?

00:25:17.599 --> 00:25:18.934
Did you look at your gift?

00:25:19.518 --> 00:25:21.061
It's a yokan, and,

00:25:21.603 --> 00:25:22.854
what's this?

00:25:23.396 --> 00:25:25.815
It's that kid's journal for the week.

00:25:26.441 --> 00:25:28.026
He always give this to us.

00:25:28.652 --> 00:25:34.866
I wonder how much he actually knows
and why he gives us these.

00:25:38.912 --> 00:25:39.746
I…

00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:43.208
I will make sure
to see this task through, no matter what!

00:25:45.293 --> 00:25:46.127
I see.

00:25:49.464 --> 00:25:51.258
I'm counting on you.

00:26:51.151 --> 00:26:53.903
Subtitle translation by: Paul Koehler
